{"3585420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legacy of Ancestors", "steam_appid": 3585420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/d1791fd34fc968317be87c42e9cacfe2.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>From wilderness to civilization. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every choice you make reshapes your lineage—and, in time, the course of society.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Legacy of Ancestors, you set out from the wilds, cross from antiquity to the modern day, <br>and live through nine reincarnations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each year’s draw-and-decide cards, each relationship you nurture, rewrites your family’s path.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/be98c640db7733f3307acd3ae31d440c.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft your identity. Body type, hair, and outfits are all customizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Starting Traits and eight core Attributes combine into <br>a unique opening build that quietly tilts early encounters and social outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.poster.avif?t=1774114333\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.webm?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.mp4?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/5f2bcd36faeb16710d1dfd90a989382e.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the first campfire spark to today’s neon, those intimate moments<br>—brave confessions, brief hesitations, wordless silences—are inscribed in the Book of Fate, quietly bending the year ahead and even the journey after rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.poster.avif?t=1774114333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.webm?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.mp4?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/1d3d773f0bfcabf2cab67b1bef4363f4.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lovers, children, and heirs are bound by golden bloodlines and bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choosing an heir isn’t just passing a torch; <br>it’s a strategic redistribution of your resources, renown, and talents—setting the prologue for your next chapter.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/6a87db15bd8827ce38e84b65919bcd71.avif?t=1774114333\" width=1348 height=996 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/c0d0c0a4bb458b72fc060b00f27b588b.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Years → Death → Meng Po’s Soup (draught of forgetfulness) → Rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With inheritance, you carry your house’s momentum forward; <br>without it, you return as a “Nameless”—a clean slate at the starting line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.poster.avif?t=1774114333\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.webm?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.mp4?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.0: during EA we’ll iterate on balance, events, and presentation based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developer, actively collecting feedback—see community channels below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community &amp; Feedback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 1045014397 (bugs &amp; suggestions)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiaohongshu: 6217732645 (dev logs, same handle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X (Twitter): </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer’s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous iteration from Demo → EA → 1.0. Priorities: balance, event-trigger stability, and localization quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a one-person project—and a responsive one. Your feedback across Demo, EA, and release will be actively incorporated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing and reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/d1791fd34fc968317be87c42e9cacfe2.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>From wilderness to civilization. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every choice you make reshapes your lineage—and, in time, the course of society.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Legacy of Ancestors, you set out from the wilds, cross from antiquity to the modern day, <br>and live through nine reincarnations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each year’s draw-and-decide cards, each relationship you nurture, rewrites your family’s path.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/be98c640db7733f3307acd3ae31d440c.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft your identity. Body type, hair, and outfits are all customizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Starting Traits and eight core Attributes combine into <br>a unique opening build that quietly tilts early encounters and social outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.poster.avif?t=1774114333\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.webm?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.mp4?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/5f2bcd36faeb16710d1dfd90a989382e.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the first campfire spark to today’s neon, those intimate moments<br>—brave confessions, brief hesitations, wordless silences—are inscribed in the Book of Fate, quietly bending the year ahead and even the journey after rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.poster.avif?t=1774114333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.webm?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.mp4?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/1d3d773f0bfcabf2cab67b1bef4363f4.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lovers, children, and heirs are bound by golden bloodlines and bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choosing an heir isn’t just passing a torch; <br>it’s a strategic redistribution of your resources, renown, and talents—setting the prologue for your next chapter.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/6a87db15bd8827ce38e84b65919bcd71.avif?t=1774114333\" width=1348 height=996 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/c0d0c0a4bb458b72fc060b00f27b588b.avif?t=1774114333\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Years → Death → Meng Po’s Soup (draught of forgetfulness) → Rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With inheritance, you carry your house’s momentum forward; <br>without it, you return as a “Nameless”—a clean slate at the starting line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.poster.avif?t=1774114333\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.webm?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.mp4?t=1774114333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.0: during EA we’ll iterate on balance, events, and presentation based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developer, actively collecting feedback—see community channels below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community &amp; Feedback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 1045014397 (bugs &amp; suggestions)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiaohongshu: 6217732645 (dev logs, same handle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X (Twitter): </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer’s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous iteration from Demo → EA → 1.0. Priorities: balance, event-trigger stability, and localization quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a one-person project—and a responsive one. Your feedback across Demo, EA, and release will be actively incorporated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing and reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "From the primitive age to the modern era, experience nine cycles of life. Make choices through card-based events, shaping your character’s stats, relationships, and fate. A strategy-driven life simulation wrapped in satire, tracing the absurd evolution of civilization.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, French, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/a4cf629a5b33814c1cddb757855e7772a8b6b801/header.jpg?t=1774114333", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/358